          "path": "specs/ui/wp63-pokegear-map-music-and-phone.md",
          "old_line": 223,
          "before": "| P33 | 打开区域地图：区域 0 未定义（或当前位置指向未定义区域） | 严格查询先抛「Unknown ID」错误，**不进入**「The map data cannot be found.」分支（WP63-R07） |",
